Package: vabaxos-checkup
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, pulseaudio-utils, network-manager
Recommends: python3-brlapi, bluez
Description: Check of the computer, said aloud
 What this computer has and whether it works for VabaxOS: sound card,
 network and Wi-Fi, battery and its wear, Braille display, Bluetooth,
 microphone, camera, memory and disk. At the first login of the installed
 system the window opens by itself and says what to look at; then the
 lessons of the keys start. vabaxos-checkup --say says the summary only.
